Neomorph is listed by OpenCode Zen as an experimental model with modular sub-network architecture (64K context, $0.50/$1.50 per 1M in/out, 4,096 max output tokens). No model card, paper, or public benchmark results are published. Web search for "Neomorph LLM" returns only a biotechnology company (Neomorph Inc., molecular glue degraders) with no connection to this AI entry. Zero verified benchmarks: self-exclusion.

